# Delta Plan — carrying steps 10–11 forward into step 12 (Context Management)

Sibling of `step_deltas/11_tui`, and the fourth hand-application of the same
carry-forward, exactly as that document predicted.

**But it is not the same kind of merge.** Steps 10 → 11 was additive: step 11
had no competing changes in `registry.rb`, `config.rb` or `boukensha_loader.rb`,
so most of it was a straight copy. Step 12 is a genuine **two-way merge**. Every
file in `12_context/` is dated 13-07-2026 — the original import, untouched since
— so step 12 is the instructor's snapshot, built on the *pre-MCP, pre-tasks*
codebase, and it carries real step-12 work of its own (`models.rb`, compaction,
turn-token budget, reasoning blocks, the OpenAI `/v1/responses` move). Neither
side is a superset. Six files need hunk-by-hunk merging, not copying.

